Description:

JMAP for Calendars now always serves JSCalendar 2.0.  A request using the
urn:ietf:params:jmap:calendars capability will be expected to work with
JSCalendar 2.0.

The event payloads that aren't tied to a request are JSCalendar 2.0 too: the
event and eventPatch of a CalendarEventNotification, and the jsevent and patch
of an iMIP notification sent to the imipnotifier.


